8	/**
9	 * RBAC-checked CSV export of the current (filtered) admin table.
10	 *
11	 *   /api/admin/export?type=users&q=…
12	 *   /api/admin/export?type=invoices&status=OPEN
13	 *
14	 * The filter params mirror the corresponding admin page so "Export CSV" always
15	 * reflects what the operator is looking at. Exports the full filtered set (not
16	 * just the current page). Never cached.
17	 */
