10	/**
11	 * SSL/TLS certificate checker — TLS-connects to host:443 (SNI = host, connecting
12	 * to a vetted public IP) and reports issuer, subject, SAN, validity window, days
13	 * to expiry, and the chain. rejectUnauthorized is off so we can still inspect
14	 * expired / self-signed / mismatched certs and tell the user what's wrong.
